{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "dropped the big numbers on the table... the market is shifted from I'm just buying because it's cheap.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000007"}, {"quote": "the market shifted. Now, people are buying very smart.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000008"}], "text": "The market has shifted from buyers purchasing properties because they are cheap to buyers purchasing properties because they know which projects, developers, and locations will sustain value."}, "title": "Understanding the Market Shift", "topic": "market_trends"}, "content_hash": "d69d34f555cd5ed88068c60a94039bebef79a09cd87a0b66a1a691ee9a95d86f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:knowledge:a6850ca971d8db8d", "metadata_hash": "ff58709b248048cbd4b3885e7ae79768270dbc0efd3b21029ab1129fa388e19f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-03-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c603a83557712279781397501c9297bc928e4b554cdfc217a8f6be9ea28726b7", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l2mO_ptlfk8", "title": "Understanding the Market Shift", "topic": "market_trends", "topic_slug": "market_trends"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000008", "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000009"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "buyers became more selective. And those buyers who are currently active on the market, they are very smart investors.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000008"}], "text": "Current market buyers are more selective, knowing which projects will sustain and make money, and active buyers have a higher risk appetite."}, "title": "Selective and Informed Buying", "topic": "buyer_behavior"}, "content_hash": "d69d34f555cd5ed88068c60a94039bebef79a09cd87a0b66a1a691ee9a95d86f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:knowledge:5bb2d3ca18f5b7b5", "metadata_hash": "ff58709b248048cbd4b3885e7ae79768270dbc0efd3b21029ab1129fa388e19f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-03-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c603a83557712279781397501c9297bc928e4b554cdfc217a8f6be9ea28726b7", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l2mO_ptlfk8", "title": "Selective and Informed Buying", "topic": "buyer_behavior", "topic_slug": "buyer_behavior"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000012", "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "smaller first-time developers which jump in the market in the past years, they gonna go.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000012"}, {"quote": "those developers will not survive.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000013"}], "text": "Smaller, first-time developers who were not performing well prior to market crises are likely to fail, as their products were only sellable through aggressive marketing practices and partnerships with master developers."}, "title": "Smaller Developers' Challenges", "topic": "developer_sustainability"}, "content_hash": "d69d34f555cd5ed88068c60a94039bebef79a09cd87a0b66a1a691ee9a95d86f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:knowledge:dadebeace1f16795", "metadata_hash": "ff58709b248048cbd4b3885e7ae79768270dbc0efd3b21029ab1129fa388e19f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-03-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c603a83557712279781397501c9297bc928e4b554cdfc217a8f6be9ea28726b7", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l2mO_ptlfk8", "title": "Smaller Developers' Challenges", "topic": "developer_sustainability", "topic_slug": "developer_sustainability"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000005"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "demonstration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The market has stopped, so I can wait and see basically, well, the price is going to be falling... and buying not one unit, maybe ten.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000004"}], "text": "An investor believes that the market has stopped and plans to wait for prices to fall before buying multiple units."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "you have to reframe the general idea that he will bring to the table.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000004"}, {"quote": "the market hasn't stopped.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000005"}], "text": "Reframe the investor's idea by explaining that the market has shifted and not stopped."}, "title": "Responding to Investor Concerns About Market Stopping", "topic": "investor_strategy"}, "content_hash": "d69d34f555cd5ed88068c60a94039bebef79a09cd87a0b66a1a691ee9a95d86f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:cases:8d6bde1888041686", "metadata_hash": "ff58709b248048cbd4b3885e7ae79768270dbc0efd3b21029ab1129fa388e19f", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-03-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c603a83557712279781397501c9297bc928e4b554cdfc217a8f6be9ea28726b7", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l2mO_ptlfk8", "title": "Responding to Investor Concerns About Market Stopping", "topic": "investor_strategy", "topic_slug": "investor_strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000007"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "seventy two hours more than six billion properties been sold.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000006"}], "text": "The speaker mentions a launch that sold six billion properties in 72 hours, using large figures to convey the market's success."}, "purpose": {"citations": [{"quote": "I'm here to show you that now the market is shifted.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:u000007"}], "text": "To demonstrate the continued activity and success of the market, despite perceptions of a halt."}, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Use of High Numbers for Impact", "topic": "rhetorical_strategies"}, "content_hash": "d69d34f555cd5ed88068c60a94039bebef79a09cd87a0b66a1a691ee9a95d86f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af:expression:426d32aac58387dc", "metadata_hash": "ff58709b248048cbd4b3885e7ae79768270dbc0efd3b21029ab1129fa388e19f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-03-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c603a83557712279781397501c9297bc928e4b554cdfc217a8f6be9ea28726b7", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-03-30-if-client-is-telling-you-i-m-hearing-alot-of-negative-new-ab-14701f23af", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l2mO_ptlfk8", "title": "Use of High Numbers for Impact", "topic": "rhetorical_strategies", "topic_slug": "rhetorical_strategies"}
